{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"4111370","name":"观鸟笔记","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >观鸟爱好者大集合！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们制作了一款桌面放置的观鸟游戏！在屏幕的一角放置属于你的小小的明信片、一扇通向另一个世界的小小窗口。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 自由装饰你的观鸟地——如果小鸟正好也喜欢这里，也许就会前来造访。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >关注我们：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方QQ 2号群：330596032</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方QQ 3号群：1079700052</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >官方#腾讯频道：观鸟笔记 频道号：guanniaobiji</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小红书、bilibili、小黑盒同名</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e5805271d577558c51dd0755fd16bade.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">多个待解锁地点，码头、海滩、荒漠、雨林……每个地方都有独属的环境和小鸟。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/0b2afa50cf03c133f0da7e29561dcc96.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cc89d1cb7da2a581fa9f3e164880970f.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">观鸟地可以任意缩放移动，陪伴你的所有屏幕时间！自由装饰你的观鸟地吧~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/69cd3f1f7b661d040eec7e820ae397a0.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e139395e7faebb4c936c9d23a716ccfa.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">蓝图系统已上线！可以保存装修、分享装修、快速切换装修！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/d67dc0692e7c8d50050b2420f3281071.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">不只有麻雀~几十种不同的小鸟，会在不同的时候前来造访。也许你还能抓拍到属于你的精彩瞬间。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/060a5ea26a641a9182d93d49003ed570.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">小鸟造访后提升小鸟好感度，能够解锁更多小鸟生态行为。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cbbb7018ddf3202922012d809e91795c.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cbbb7018ddf3202922012d809e91795c.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/cbbb7018ddf3202922012d809e91795c.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/20a3eafb0d4a82fcdb7eb855e8ee88bb.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">拍下那些有趣又温柔的瞬间吧</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2055957bd752add3829e5a772e00bb35.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2055957bd752add3829e5a772e00bb35.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/2055957bd752add3829e5a772e00bb35.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/a50fe3f25b9ebcb7dd80c24ff9f03d1c.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">今天加新了什么鸟？还有观鸟地、建筑、拍照、成就……一切收入图鉴笔记中！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/7ad147532cd321b640db923feff556f6.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/7ad147532cd321b640db923feff556f6.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/7ad147532cd321b640db923feff556f6.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">放大小鸟头像，更多小鸟的辨别特征等待解锁</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e2e82b94a7486e22b9d1be43693e8ce5.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e2e82b94a7486e22b9d1be43693e8ce5.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/e2e82b94a7486e22b9d1be43693e8ce5.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/f1911528ffb4508d7ad048a29b05b197.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">现在可以切换观鸟地的昼夜和晴雨状态——无论何时打开，都有适合此刻环境与心情的观鸟地陪伴……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">夜间会有夜行小鸟等待与你邂逅～</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/b72ea69471781bb30eb2dcd92b85bf70.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/d4f2f7ab442bf7f0b77cd26bd4375309.avif?t=1779839297\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras_big/d4f2f7ab442bf7f0b77cd26bd4375309.webp?t=1779839297 width=1560 height=273 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">大家一起来观鸟！化身小鸟降落在朋友的观鸟地，留下表情、照片雨掉落物作为小小纪念。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">还可以申请收藏他人的观鸟地蓝图，把喜欢的布置灵感带回自己的小鸟大陆。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/744030c9451ac61a64c49013ab81aada.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/a1cadb17d455327f3f999ca33517a846.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">小鸟会带来不同的礼物，收集它们！有各种颜色的羽毛，也许还有……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/1c280ba5bacf6b09e6913755f3338a3b.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/5c58cabc7a493e7dbcda75604e494e9e.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1280 height=177 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">鸦老板喜欢亮晶晶的一切：亮闪闪的羽毛、瓶盖，还有它会奉还给你的金币~！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.poster.avif?t=1779839297\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.webm?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/extras/282cff83ed12d9b2133a8b275aba0aab.mp4?t=1779839297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/c1545bbfcd73101a1519a30de5defcd98a900343/header_schinese.jpg?t=1779839297","website":"","developers":["Biekka Games"],"publishers":["Biekka Games"],"release_date":"2026 年 5 月 26 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"EUR","initial":"10.25","final":"9.22","discount":10},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 简体中文<strong>*</strong>, 繁体中文<strong>*</strong>, 法语<strong>*</strong>, 日语<strong>*</strong>, 韩语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","合作","在线合作","Steam 成就","家庭共享"],"genres":["休闲"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel i3 Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> Intel HD 3000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 500 MB 可用空间</li></ul>","recommended":""},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d81d64767b534717e69ba47b1f5be2f4719b4c69/ss_d81d64767b534717e69ba47b1f5be2f4719b4c69.600x338.jpg?t=1779839297","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/d81d64767b534717e69ba47b1f5be2f4719b4c69/ss_d81d64767b534717e69ba47b1f5be2f4719b4c69.1920x1080.jpg?t=1779839297"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/f5071a784347c1d3772b772f1e1a05b33798824a/ss_f5071a784347c1d3772b772f1e1a05b33798824a.600x338.jpg?t=1779839297","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111370/f5071a784347c1d3772b772f1e1a05b33798824a/ss_f507